\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Lord Jesus, we look to Thee,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Let us in Thy name agree:
\par Show thyself The Prince of Peace;
\par Bid all strife for ever cease.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Make us of one heart and mind
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Courteous, pitiful and kind,
\par Lowly, meek in thought and word,
\par Altogether like the Lord.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Let us for each other care,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Each, the other's burden bear,
\par  To Thy church the pattern give,
\par Show how true believers live.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Free from anger and from pride,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Let us thus in God abide;
\par All the depths of love express,
\par All the heights of holiness.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Closer knit to Thee, our Head,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Nourish us, O Christ, and feed!
\par Let us daily grace receive,
\par More and more in Jesus live.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.   Fill us with the Fathers love,\tab 
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Never from our souls remove;
\par Dwell in us , and we shall be
\par \pard       Thine through all eternity.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

